\title{trca: Topological Relational Class Analysis}
\description{
Implements Topological Relational Class Analysis ('tRCA'), a method for recovering positions, construals, and the relational topology among them from attitudinal survey data. 'tRCA' treats survey responses as a signed respondent-item bipartite network, embeds respondents and items jointly with a signed spectral decomposition, and summarises the alignment, opposition, and orthogonality among the recovered positions in a signed block density matrix. The package also provides baselines for Relational Class Analysis ('RCA'; Goldberg (2011) \doi{10.1086/657976}), simulators for canonical topologies, and plotting tools.
}
